      "summary_en": "Aurelion Sol's damaging Abilities break down enemies into stacks of Stardust, which permanently improves each of his abilities.",
      "summary_zh": "奥瑞利安·索尔的伤害型技能会将敌人们化为星尘，星尘可用来永久增强他的每个技能。",
