      "status_terms_zh": [
        "晕眩",
        "击飞",
        "减速"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Falling Star: Aurelion Sol crashes a star into the earth. This impact deals magic damage and stuns enemies while also granting Stardust for each enemy champion it hits. Gathering enough Stardust transforms Aurelion Sol's next Falling Star into The Skies Descend. The Skies Descend: Aurelion Sol drags a giant star down from the heavens with an increased impact zone and increased damage, knocking up enemies rather than stunning them. A shockwave then spreads from the edge of the impact zone, which damages and slows the enemies it hits. Stardust increases the impact area of both Falling Star and The Skies Descend.",
      "summary_zh": "星落：奥瑞利安 · 索尔召唤一颗星辰坠落地面。这次冲击造成魔法伤害并眩晕敌人，并且每命中一个敌方英雄还会提供星尘。收集足够的星尘后，奥瑞利安·索尔的下一次星落将会升级为天瀑。 天瀑：奥瑞利安 · 索尔从诸天拽下一颗巨大的星辰撞击地面，拥有提升过的冲击范围和提升过的伤害，并且会对敌人们造成击飞而非晕眩。随后会有一道冲击波从冲击范围的边缘散播出去，对命中的敌人们造成伤害和减速。星尘会提升【星落】和【天瀑】的冲击范围。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": []
    }
